H-43 execution fitness frozen test fixture.

C_good: a candidate whose eval_log contains the expected output tokens -> high pass-rate.
C_bad:  a candidate whose eval_log is missing or wrong -> low pass-rate.

The test set hash is the blake3 of the corpus bytes (computed at test time from
the inline fixture bytes in h43_execution_fitness_contract.rs -- no separate file
is required for the Tier-1 in-process scorer).

Gate-frozen (R8): this directory is read-only to the running admit loop.
A candidate cannot inject into this fixture.
